    {
      "subId": "7320404",
      "subQuestName": "Talk to Affan",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732040401"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732040401": {
            "id": "732040401",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "You two are back? How is the nursery? Do you think it can be saved?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040402"
            ]
          },
          "732040402": {
            "id": "732040402",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "We've taken care of it.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040403"
            ]
          },
          "732040403": {
            "id": "732040403",
            "speakerId": 1002,
            "speakerName": "Black Screen",
            "text": "You explain the Withering to Affan.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040404"
            ]
          },
          "732040404": {
            "id": "732040404",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "I see. So that's why. I knew something was off when so much black stuff just appeared out of the ground.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040405"
            ]
          },
          "732040405": {
            "id": "732040405",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Good, good. Now I can finally plant some seeds without worries.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040406"
            ]
          },
          "732040406": {
            "id": "732040406",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "When these three seeds sprout, bloom and produce seeds again, I'll plant them in the ground there. Then the land will be covered with these flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040407"
            ]
          },
          "732040407": {
            "id": "732040407",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Eh? These strangely-shaped rocks...? Can flowers grow out of them?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040408"
            ]
          },
          "732040408": {
            "id": "732040408",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Where did you buy these from, Grandpa Affan? Did you get scammed or something?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040409"
            ]
          },
          "732040409": {
            "id": "732040409",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "You have good hearts. But don't worry, children. Mora can't buy these flower seeds.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040410"
            ]
          },
          "732040410": {
            "id": "732040410",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "The old... I mean, a friend of mine gave me these three precious seeds. So of course they are different from normal seedlings.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040411"
            ]
          },
          "732040411": {
            "id": "732040411",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "The more Paimon hears about it, the weirder it sounds. Grandpa Affan, just what are you growing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040412"
            ]
          },
          "732040412": {
            "id": "732040412",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Hehe, what I'm planting is a friend's wish.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040413"
            ]
          },
          "732040413": {
            "id": "732040413",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "What a strange answer. Can you really plant that sort of thing?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040414"
            ]
          },
          "732040414": {
            "id": "732040414",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Child, you wouldn't understand even if I told you. Come visit me again when you get the chance.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040415"
            ]
          },
          "732040415": {
            "id": "732040415",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "This field might look empty now, but these three seeds will one day sprout and bloom in this nursery.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040416"
            ]
          },
          "732040416": {
            "id": "732040416",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "There will be more and more of them in the future. Haha, and they will surely create a beautiful scene.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040417"
            ]
          },
          "732040417": {
            "id": "732040417",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Alright, alright. Since I asked for your help, I will be sure to compensate you.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040418"
            ]
          },
          "732040418": {
            "id": "732040418",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Take this, children. I can't give you much, so this is all.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040419"
            ]
          },
          "732040419": {
            "id": "732040419",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Phew, commission complete! Paimon's a little hungry after all that running around.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040420"
            ]
          },
          "732040420": {
            "id": "732040420",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "I was the one running though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040421"
            ]
          },
          "732040421": {
            "id": "732040421",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Well, Paimon was providing running commentary. That takes energy too!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040422"
            ]
          },
          "732040422": {
            "id": "732040422",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Don't sweat the small stuff! How about we use our payment to buy ourselves a treat, hmm?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040423"
            ]
          },
          "732040423": {
            "id": "732040423",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "C'mon, let's see how much we got and how many meals we can buy.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040424"
            ]
          },
          "732040424": {
            "id": "732040424",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Let's see...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040425"
            ]
          },
          "732040425": {
            "id": "732040425",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Ah, most of the stuff here is food instead of Mora... Shawarma, Tahchin, and lots of vegetables.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040426"
            ]
          },
          "732040426": {
            "id": "732040426",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is way too much. Did we take a whole day's rations away from Grandpa Affan?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040427"
            ]
          },
          "732040427": {
            "id": "732040427",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "But he lives alone outside the village. It can't be easy for him, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040428"
            ]
          },
          "732040428": {
            "id": "732040428",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Never mind the Mora. If he gave us all his rations, then... It just feels wrong.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040429"
            ]
          },
          "732040429": {
            "id": "732040429",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "And he was planting seeds that looked like stones, saying that he was planting... a wish?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040430"
            ]
          },
          "732040430": {
            "id": "732040430",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "Is it possible that he's been living on his own for so long that he's started to imagine things?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040431"
            ]
          },
          "732040431": {
            "id": "732040431",
            "speakerId": 1005,
            "speakerName": "Paimon",
            "text": "This is worrying. Let's pay him a visit when we can find the time."
          }
        }
      }
    },
