    {
      "subId": "7320407",
      "subQuestName": "",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732040701"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732040701": {
            "id": "732040701",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Ah, I haven't had time to cook yet, so I'm afraid I have nothing with which to receive you as guests.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040704"
            ]
          },
          "732040704": {
            "id": "732040704",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "So, this other kid is your friend, huh? She's pretty cute.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040705"
            ]
          },
          "732040705": {
            "id": "732040705",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Do you want to come see the flowers when they bloom?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040706"
            ]
          },
          "732040706": {
            "id": "732040706",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "No problem.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040707"
            ]
          },
          "732040707": {
            "id": "732040707",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "They will most likely bloom in a few days. Come back later to see the flowers you helped to plant.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040708"
            ]
          },
          "732040708": {
            "id": "732040708",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Okay.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040709"
            ]
          },
          "732040709": {
            "id": "732040709",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "Alright, I understand.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732040710"
            ]
          },
          "732040710": {
            "id": "732040710",
            "speakerId": 4233,
            "speakerName": "Affan",
            "text": "♪..."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "subId": "7320306",
      "subQuestName": "Additional",
      "sceneId": null,
      "locations": [],
      "dialogue": {
        "startDialogs": [
          "732030605"
        ],
        "dialogs": {
          "732030605": {
            "id": "732030605",
            "speakerId": -1,
            "speakerName": "Player",
            "text": "Which Darshan were you with, by the way?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030606"
            ]
          },
          "732030606": {
            "id": "732030606",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Oh, I could talk for three whole days about that!",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030607"
            ]
          },
          "732030607": {
            "id": "732030607",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I was with Amurta and specialized in plant evolution, so you could say my work was evidence-based.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030608"
            ]
          },
          "732030608": {
            "id": "732030608",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "That means it is impossible to reach new conclusions without new forms of evidence. Simply put, fossils are necessary for the study of historical plants.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030609"
            ]
          },
          "732030609": {
            "id": "732030609",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "But there are only so many fossil samples available, and the Akademiya is limited in its ability to provide new ones.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030610"
            ]
          },
          "732030610": {
            "id": "732030610",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Those were the circumstances, yet the institute still demanded results.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030611"
            ]
          },
          "732030611": {
            "id": "732030611",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "So some people would just take a previous study, revise or add something to it, and turn it in. You also find that quite pointless, right?",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030612"
            ]
          },
          "732030612": {
            "id": "732030612",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "In truth, we could make new discoveries for sure if we looked towards history and geography for new materials.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030613"
            ]
          },
          "732030613": {
            "id": "732030613",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Certain literary documents that Amurta would usually ignore could be used as well, though that would surely cross into Vahumana and Haravatat territory.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030614"
            ]
          },
          "732030614": {
            "id": "732030614",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I was not proficient in those fields, and requesting the related files was too troublesome, never mind working with their researchers...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030615"
            ]
          },
          "732030615": {
            "id": "732030615",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "But I believe that if we could actually work together as a team, many questions of the past would finally be answered.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030616"
            ]
          },
          "732030616": {
            "id": "732030616",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "It's a shame that we couldn't continue our collaboration attempts. I must say that people in Vahumana and Haravatat have very peculiar perspectives, though...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030617"
            ]
          },
          "732030617": {
            "id": "732030617",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I had to be very careful with my wording and phrasing in my submissions to them to avoid misunderstandings and misinterpretations.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030618"
            ]
          },
          "732030618": {
            "id": "732030618",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Before I was kicked out of the Akademiya, I was still in the middle of an argument with someone from Haravatat. Now I can't even do that...",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030625"
            ]
          },
          "732030625": {
            "id": "732030625",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Ah, I just rambled for a long time... But it feels good.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030626"
            ]
          },
          "732030626": {
            "id": "732030626",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Before you got here, I really didn't have many friends, and it could get pretty lonely.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030629"
            ]
          },
          "732030629": {
            "id": "732030629",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "Very few people in the village are into gardening.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030630"
            ]
          },
          "732030630": {
            "id": "732030630",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "...Well, that's not entirely true. An old man living to the north of the village also plowed a plot to grow flowers.",
            "nextDialogs": [
              "732030631"
            ]
          },
          "732030631": {
            "id": "732030631",
            "speakerId": 4232,
            "speakerName": "Sabbah",
            "text": "I've visited him before. He's a slightly eccentric old man.",
